7TallPIdeal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}tall\\text{-}p\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7TallPIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\omega\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\forall A\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists B\\in[A]^\\omega\\;(B\\in\\mathcal I)\\land\\forall\\vec A\\in{}^\\omega\\mathcal I\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec A(n)\\setminus B\\in[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}tall\\text{-}p\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7TallPIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\omega\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\forall A\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists B\\in[A]^\\omega\\;(B\\in\\mathcal I)\\land\\forall\\vec A\\in{}^\\omega\\mathcal I\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec A(n)\\setminus B\\in[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>